      "id": "claim_518f663eaf654d3f813f0c0833e36d82",
      "statement": "After successful LLM processing, `reprocess` combines built-in corrections with existing configured dictionary files, overwrites the LLM output with corrections and then rendered template output using derived source/date-tag metadata, and finally moves the raw text to `text-processed`; it does not call routing or project classification.",
