      "id": "claim_939de617cba642119ed90a4ad804dbeb",
      "statement": "The implemented Ollama formatter creates the output parent, feeds raw text to `ollama run <model>` with a 900-second timeout, removes ANSI escape sequences and one recognized leading thinking trace, and writes cleaned stdout; timeout, nonzero subprocess exit, and missing executable become unsuccessful `ProcessResult` values.",
